(text "S-band module and supply selection are complete; external inline pod assembly, cable loss, gain/NF and\nthermal/current measurements remain unqualified.\nВорота (стенд): Build the specified LaNA WB 100845 + cf2235 + DC blocks in the Hammond 1554U2GY pod; verify\nstacked fit/cable bends, weather seals and strain relief. Measure LaNA current/inrush at protected 5 V,\n2.2–2.3 GHz S21/NF/linearity, and receiver protection. Do not substitute generic nominal NF for the actual\nS-band measurement." (at 323.85 38.93 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid cbdf43c5-805b-515b-acaa-36836e6b11db))
